---
description: >-
  Same three-lane query-escalation flow as `query-process.mmd` (StatusSeeker
  routes an incoming query up to "Tech Lead" and then "Head of Engineering"
  until someone can answer), but with lanes declared in flow order
  (StatusSeeker, then "Head of Engineering", then "Tech Lead") and using
  plain `layout: swimlane` without the ignoreCrossLaneEdges/
  optimizeRanksByCrossings tuning options.
config:
  logLevel: 0
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    useMaxWidth: false
  layout: swimlane
---
swimlane-beta LR

  subgraph StatusSeeker
  A(Incoming query)
  A2{Knows<br/>which team?}
  end

  subgraph "Head of Engineering"
    E{Can answer?}
    E --Yes--> F(Answer)
    E --No --> G(Investigate) --> F2(Answer)
  end
  subgraph "Tech Lead"
    B{Can answer?}
    B --Yes--> C(Answer)

  end
  A --> A2
  A2 --Yes --> B
  A2 --No --> E
  B --No --> E
